msgid ""
"1. All staff responses to citizens must remain respectful, formal, and "
"written in clear language (Somali or English)."
msgstr ""
"1. Dhammaan jawaabaha shaqaaluhu u qoraan muwaadiniintu waa inay ahaadaan "
"kuwo ixtiraam leh, rasmi ah, oo ku qoran luqad cad (Soomaali ama Ingiriisi)."

msgid "100% Secure & Private"
msgstr "100% Ammaan & Qarsoodi"

msgid ""
"2. Use the 'Request Info' action to send clarifying requests instead of "
"making assumptions. This notifies the citizen automatically."
msgstr ""
"2. Isticmaal tallaabada 'Codso Xog' si aad u dirto codsiyo caddayn ah halkii"
" aad wax mala-awaali lahayd. Tani si toos ah ayay muwaadinka u ogeysiisaa."

msgid "24/7 Diplomatic Rescue Service"
msgstr "Adeegga Gurmadka Diblomaasiyadeed 24/7"

msgid ""
"3. Every single status modification, assignment action, and internal note is"
" securely stored on a read-only audit log database for transparency reviews."
msgstr ""
"3. Isbeddel kasta oo xaalad, tallaabo qoondayn, iyo qoraal gudaha ah waxaa "
"si ammaan ah loogu kaydiyaa diiwaan hubin oo akhris-keliya ah si loo sameeyo"
" dib-u-eegisyo daahfurnaan."

